        :rulingText """You don't choose a target for Wick's Patrol's ability at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you mill three cards this way. You choose a target for this ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal."""@en ] ,
